  <title>Credit card statement history</title>

  <p><guiseq><gui>Reports</gui><gui>Credit card statements</gui></guiseq>
  works like <link xref="bank_statements"/>, for a credit card account:
  choose the card, filter by reconcile date, and list the transactions
  <gui>Single</gui>, <gui>Grouped</gui> or <gui>Linked (Beta)</gui>. The window
  menu has <gui>Expand all</gui>, <gui>Collapse all</gui> and <gui>Report
  hub</gui>.</p>

  <p>With <gui>Edit mode</gui> checked in the window menu, which asks for the
  administrator password, unchecking <gui>Reconciled</gui> on a line takes it
  back off its statement. Reconciling is only done in <link
  xref="credit_card_statements"/>.</p>

</page>
